{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110114","id":2786808468,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6mG1KU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110114","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110114.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110114","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110114/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110114/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110114/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/45b3967c788453c1cce60e9075cda76385f89f8b","number":110114,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Windows,Linux] [Input] Return the keyboard ID for raw input","user":{"login":"knn217","id":86541274,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTQxMjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86541274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217","html_url":"https://github.com/knn217","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knn217/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Based on [#13083](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13083)\r\n\r\n- Return the keyboard ID from raw input in InputEventKey as `device`\r\n- When adding Input mapping, the Input events's `device` will be normalized to `ALL_DEVICE`, \r\n- Normalizing to a default `device` value for input map id safer, since raw input's id can change in runtime by unplugging/plugging back the keyboard\r\n- If users wish to separate by keyboard ID, they need to get the event 's `device` to tell which keyboard the event is from, and handle hot-remapping if the ID was changed in runtime\r\n- Added in 2nd commit: The returned `device` is now ordered starting from 0, and registered by plugin/input. Unplugging a keyboard will leave its `device` open for a new keyboard to register to\r\n\r\nTest with GDScript:\r\n```\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _input(event):\r\n\tif event is InputEventKey and event.pressed and not event.echo:\r\n\t\tprint(\"Pressed: \", OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode), \"| ID: \", event.device)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1127\" height=\"586\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db97525b-9dfd-4bf1-80c8-9f20be083440\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTest with GDExtension:\r\n```\r\nvoid App::_input(const godot::Ref<godot::InputEvent> &event)\r\n{\r\n    godot::Ref<godot::InputEventKey> key_event = event;\r\n    if (key_event.is_valid()){\r\n        if (key_event->is_pressed() && !key_event->is_echo()) {\r\n            godot::String key_name = godot::OS::get_singleton()->get_keycode_string(key_event->get_keycode());\r\n            std::int64_t keyboard_id = key_event->get_device();\r\n            godot::UtilityFunctions::print(\"Pressed: \", key_name, \" | ID: \", keyboard_id);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"1000\" height=\"480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01390f91-2847-41ac-95e8-41c2849481cf\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"670\" height=\"667\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc534c77-4323-4d4c-97b4-84dc677336a5\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nTest input mapping:\r\nTested action created from GDScript, with an event for pressing key right, the action triggered with multiple keyboard ids (0, 1)\r\n```\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tInputMap.add_action(\"ui_right_custom\")\r\n\tvar event := InputEventKey.new()\r\n\tevent.physical_keycode = KEY_RIGHT\r\n\tevent.pressed = true\r\n\tevent.echo = false\r\n\tInputMap.action_add_event(\"ui_right_custom\", event)\r\n\r\nfunc _process(_delta):\r\n\tif Input.is_action_pressed(\"ui_right_custom\", false):\r\n\t\tprint(\"GDScript moving right\")\r\n\r\nfunc _input(event):\r\n\tif event is InputEventKey:\r\n\t\tif not event.echo:\r\n\t\t\tif event.pressed:\r\n\t\t\t\tprint(\"GDScript Pressed: \", OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode), \"| ID: \", event.device)\r\n\t\t\telse:\r\n\t\t\t\tprint(\"GDScript Released: \", OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode), \"| ID: \", event.device)\r\n\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"1228\" height=\"887\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f90496bf-516a-46b1-b123-f8f38bc78f8a\" />\r\n\r\nTested with an action from the input map setting\r\n```\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _process(_delta):\r\n\tif Input.is_action_pressed(\"ui_left_custom\", false):\r\n\t\tprint(\"GDScript moving left\")\r\n\r\nfunc _input(event):\r\n\tif event is InputEventKey:\r\n\t\tif not event.echo:\r\n\t\t\tif event.pressed:\r\n\t\t\t\tprint(\"GDScript Pressed: \", OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode), \"| ID: \", event.device)\r\n\t\t\telse:\r\n\t\t\t\tprint(\"GDScript Released: \", OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode), \"| ID: \", event.device)\r\n\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"913\" height=\"455\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eeb006db-44c3-443b-9fe9-e476b0638067\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1247\" height=\"773\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b35a0ca3-4cd9-40da-9e62-258a5972e2b4\" />\r\n\r\nTest on Linux X11 (Ubuntu 24.04):\r\n<img width=\"1117\" height=\"793\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6648acc1-65a5-458d-b7b1-543d2ba2ddca\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13083.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_